# Media Rules

Supabase Storage (private buckets, signed URLs):
- product images
- product short videos
- application/profile images
- transport media
- uploaded lesson files and course thumbnails

YouTube Unlisted:
- AgriAcademy training videos

Do not add ImageKit or Bunny Stream. Those providers are retired.
Supabase stores media metadata and the object bytes for the buckets above.
Do not use Map/Set/global memory as durable media state.
Prefer direct signed uploads.
Never expose provider secrets.
